240
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:05,360
It hasn't even been two weeks
since the song came out.

241
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:09,440
That's right. And the music video
has already passed 100 million views.

242
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:15,919
Everything they put out hits 100 million.
And the cycle keeps getting shorter.

243
00:19:15,919 --> 00:19:22,520
It happens in a flash now. — Right. Yes.
In the music video, each member

244
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:26,240
shows off emotional acting, I hear.
So who's the member with the most acting talent?

245
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:30,280
Oh, the music video is playing right now.
— Shall we take a look?

246
00:19:30,280 --> 00:19:32,240
It's RORA, right? RORA. — That's right.

247
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:35,120
RORA looks so natural. — Are you all right?

248
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:38,440
Oh. Oh — it suddenly changes. Suddenly.

249
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:42,559
It suddenly goes dark. It went dark, and then—

250
00:19:42,559 --> 00:19:46,401
this part is about coming off stage and feeling

251
00:19:46,401 --> 00:19:50,080
the emptiness — even the emptiness backstage.

252
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:57,500
(watching the music video)

253
00:19:57,960 --> 00:20:05,360
It's a style clearly different from
what they've done until now. — A more mature feel.

254
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:09,120
Oh wow. CHIQUITA.

255
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:14,140
Let's each pick the member who pulled off

256
00:20:14,140 --> 00:20:18,440
that emotional acting best. RORA, first —

257
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:22,520
someone other than yourself. Not yourself.

258
00:20:22,520 --> 00:20:26,440
Me? I was about to pick me.
Mm, yes, yes. Then—

259
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:32,549
ASA. Because, watch later — in the scene

260
00:20:32,549 --> 00:20:36,520
where the rain pours down,

261
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:39,200
she nailed that wailing feeling.
— ASA. — Oh. — Thank you.

262
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:41,679
Now ASA, you received it — who do you
pass it to? Who did well in return?

263
00:20:41,679 --> 00:20:47,840
This time we filmed individually,
so we didn't know how the others did.

264
00:20:47,840 --> 00:20:52,120
