was really good. They did well, but still—

265
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:56,280
I kind of thought I did the best.

266
00:20:56,280 --> 00:21:03,480
Ah. — It was good. — One person. One person.

267
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:06,929
Still — RORA's intro.

268
00:21:06,929 --> 00:21:11,200
RORA's intro was the best.

269
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:14,039
Oh, then I was about to hand it to the next
person, but I guess it ends with me.

270
00:21:14,039 --> 00:21:18,240
I was supposed to pass it on, but the two of
us just exchanged it and it ended.

271
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:21,400
Sorry. — Everyone was just too good.
— Exactly.

272
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:27,720
Well then, since you all did so well —
