So, yes.

280
00:21:57,279 --> 00:21:59,799
So it's like sending them off, coolly.

281
00:21:59,799 --> 00:22:05,120
Yes. But you can't really send them off coolly.
Because you loved that person so much —

282
00:22:05,120 --> 00:22:08,000
