284
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:16,120
There is none. — None?
— None at all.

285
00:22:16,120 --> 00:22:18,440
Then this is a first, isn't it?
— Yes, it's a first.

286
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:23,279
On stage — just standing at the mic,
holding nothing but the mic—

287
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:27,640
