442
00:34:52,240 --> 00:34:56,960
Next. — Next: "BABYMONSTER,
you said this too!"

443
00:34:56,960 --> 00:34:59,895
Fun. So fun. In an interview held

444
00:34:59,895 --> 00:35:05,320
in Japan last year, AHYEON said this.
Please say it yourself.

445
00:35:05,320 --> 00:35:09,760
I'll deliver it as-is: I went with CHIQUITA
to an all-you-can-eat shabu-shabu place,

446
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:13,440
and refilled the meat 12 times
and the thin rice cakes 15 times.

447
00:35:13,440 --> 00:35:18,200
— Fun. — Fun. — Fun. Mmm.

448
00:35:18,200 --> 00:35:22,070
The meat, 12 times.
— Do you really eat that much?

449
00:35:22,070 --> 00:35:24,160
That much actually goes in?

450
00:35:24,160 --> 00:35:26,359
— Yes. — Wow, really?
— Meat, you can eat lots of without gaining,

451
00:35:26,359 --> 00:35:29,960
but rice cakes, still—
— We refilled the rice cakes even more. 15 times.

452
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:33,800
Rice cakes are pure carbs, though.
Carbs, I mean.

453
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:38,334
But they give you so little. Each order
of rice cakes is only two pieces,

454
00:35:38,334 --> 00:35:40,880
so you have no choice but to order a lot.

455
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:43,200
— Ah. — Well done. Well done. — Yes.

456
00:35:43,200 --> 00:35:48,280
Then that's 30 pieces.
Even doing the math, 30 pieces.

457
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:52,160
Now, we have to let them go.
BABYMONSTER.

458
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:56,319
— Do we have to do this corner?
— Next. It's over now. — Ah, sorry. Yes.

459
00:35:56,319 --> 00:35:58,223
Yes. Until we bring you back for the seventh

460
00:35:58,223 --> 00:36:00,560
time — how long will we have to wait?
— I know, right.

461
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:02,520
Aha.

462
00:36:02,520 --> 00:36:08,319
Finally — one member, please give
the closing greeting. Yes. How was today?

463
00:36:08,319 --> 00:36:14,632
Yes. Today was our sixth appearance

464
00:36:14,632 --> 00:36:18,240
on Cultwo Show, and—

465
00:36:18,240 --> 00:36:23,589
to stamp that lucky seven,
we'll come back for our seventh

466
00:36:23,589 --> 00:36:26,079
as soon as we possibly can.

467
00:36:26,079 --> 00:36:28,636
Wow. And everyone who came today cheered

468
00:36:28,636 --> 00:36:33,240
along with us so well — we took that energy
and poured it into the live.

469
00:36:33,240 --> 00:36:34,319
Sounds like fun. Ah —

470
00:36:34,319 --> 00:36:37,160
BABYMONSTER, bye! — BABYMONSTER,
"You Deserve It" — fighting!

471
00:36:37,160 --> 00:36:42,920
Fighting! And so, until now —
this has been BABYMONSTER!

472
00:36:43,839 --> 00:36:47,599
♪ Hello ♪

